{"pdfData":[[{"bbox":[86,74,123,85],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":0,"text":"# 逐字稿","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"d5f07923-75c7-4f3a-97d9-49c7196bcb34","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-0"},{"bbox":[86,99,391,113],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"我接下来将介绍病毒分子进化机制中的一个关键过程——重组。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"83d9b4e2-9caf-43cc-a269-b45afd014d10","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-1"},{"bbox":[86,125,508,157],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"SARS-CoV-2 是一种 RNA 病毒，它的重组并不是我们在真核生物中熟悉的染色体重组，而是一种发生在复制过程中的模板切换。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"c9035fcf-96c2-4e8c-8bbc-e04e1da97dc7","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-2"},{"bbox":[86,169,505,219],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"具体来说，当两个不同病毒谱系同时感染同一个宿主细胞时，病毒的 RNA依赖RNA聚合酶 会在复制 RNA 的过程中，从一个模板“跳跃”到另一个模板上继续复制。最终，就会形成一个由不同来源片段拼接而成的“嵌合基因组”。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"fafc2a8a-c3e4-4a6f-b65e-85397807ba81","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-3"},{"bbox":[86,231,500,263],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"这个过程有时也被称为 copy-choice 机制，本质上并不是基因交换，而是复制过程中的“轨道切换”。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"75e42084-48b5-4a34-b5d3-3b6e892b59c9","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-4"},{"bbox":[87,275,336,290],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"为了更好理解这种机制，我们可以做一个简单对比。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"d8af3541-c59f-4a28-a50d-ef79c594a771","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-5"},{"bbox":[86,301,500,333],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"在真核生物中，重组通常发生在减数分裂过程中，涉及同源染色体的配对和片段交换，是一种结构化、受控的遗传过程。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"f39515df-3a3d-477f-960f-8bf013509cfb","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-6"},{"bbox":[86,345,504,377],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"而在原核生物中，比如细菌，重组通常通过转化、接合或转导实现，本质上是细胞之间的基因流动，依赖外源 DNA 或质粒。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"73b01d36-eba3-4f75-921b-2388c2ce33c7","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-7"},{"bbox":[86,390,505,439],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"相比之下，SARS-CoV-2 的重组既不依赖染色体配对，也不依赖外源 DNA 的摄取，而是发生在病毒 RNA 复制瞬间的一次“模板跳跃”。这体现了病毒进化机制的高度简化和高效。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"49dd0d04-76a5-4217-8b4b-4a4f5cef1c9c","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-8"},{"bbox":[86,452,504,519],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"merge_prev":false,"text":"而SARS-CoV-2 的模板切换之所以能够高效发生，是因为 RdRp 与 RNA 结合相对不稳定，在共感染条件下周围存在大量相似模板，同时 RNA 的序列同源性和二级结构为重新配对提供了条件。再加上冠状病毒本身具有跳跃式转录机制，使得这种‘换轨复制’不仅可能，而且高效，具有选择性。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"37727b8b-a2b3-4286-a7db-574f1c7f8a39","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-9"},{"bbox":[86,532,495,545],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":10,"merge_prev":false,"text":"接下来我们看一个非常典型的例子，也就是 Omicron 时代的重要重组谱系——XBB。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"a424e3a9-736c-464b-aca4-6efcf8eacd7b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-10"},{"bbox":[86,558,502,590],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"merge_prev":false,"text":"研究表明，XBB 是由两个 BA.2 亚谱系，BJ.1 和 BM.1.1.1，通过重组产生的。它的重组断点位于刺突蛋白的受体结合域，也就是 Spike RBD 区域。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"e32ac4d3-4c7c-4af9-9912-61a1e7b55f08","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-11"},{"bbox":[86,602,505,634],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"merge_prev":false,"text":"这个位置非常关键，因为它直接决定病毒与宿主细胞受体的结合能力，同时也是中和抗体的主要作用靶点。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"03d14d5a-c128-468c-aa61-43bb847822e0","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-12"},{"bbox":[86,646,505,678],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":13,"merge_prev":false,"text":"因此，XBB 的不同基因片段组合在一起，使它同时具备更强的免疫逃逸能力和一定程度的传播优势。这种“功能叠加”，正是重组最重要的进化意义之一。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"8bb8263c-0e3a-4074-978c-3ccf70808230","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-13"},{"bbox":[86,690,505,723],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":14,"merge_prev":false,"text":"从更宏观的角度来看，在 Omicron 流行阶段，病毒的进化并不是单一机制驱动的，而是多种机制共同作用的结果，包括抗原漂移、趋同进化，以及我们这里重点讨论的重组。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"f19f7024-aa61-416f-8395-a55e873f692c","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-14"},{"bbox":[86,734,502,766],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":15,"merge_prev":false,"text":"大规模系统发育研究显示，在 160 万条病毒基因组序列中，已经检测到589 个重组事件，约2.7 % 的序列具有可识别的重组祖先。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"7ecdf12e-91c7-4736-a2a8-2300b07a990e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-15"}],[{"bbox":[86,73,506,105],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"更有意思的是，这些重组断点并不是随机分布的，而是明显集中在病毒基因组的 3’端区域，尤其是 Spike 基因附近。这说明重组在功能上可能受到选择压力的影响。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"f034e603-fa57-40f2-a2b0-81e32c626900","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-0"},{"bbox":[86,117,292,132],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"那么，为什么重组对 Omicron 尤其重要？","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"c003be79-0b15-4c75-9a99-19a20cf486f7","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-1"},{"bbox":[86,143,505,175],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"原因在于，突变通常是逐步积累的，而重组可以在一次事件中，将多个已经存在的有利突变组合到一起，从而显著加快进化速度。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"17b8a7d1-26c9-49a5-b6c1-2970aff38425","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-2"},{"bbox":[86,187,499,201],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"换句话说，重组相当于一种“进化加速器”，使病毒能够更快适应宿主免疫系统的压力。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"64262049-5824-4cc7-be5b-c10c660765de","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-3"},{"bbox":[86,213,271,228],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"最后，我用一句话总结这一部分内容：","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"a5107b7e-c2d3-4c47-a777-a676c26f9eca","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-4"},{"bbox":[86,240,504,272],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"真核生物的重组，是染色体层面的遗传重排；原核生物的重组，是细胞之间的基因流动；而 SARS-CoV-2 的重组，是复制过程中发生的模板切换。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"10d2d9bc-46b3-4796-ba1b-6f6bb6ecf55b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-5"},{"bbox":[86,283,505,316],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"它的独特之处在于，可以在一次事件中整合多个有利突变，从而帮助 Omicron 亚型快速获得免疫逃逸和传播优势。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"87abde0c-2337-45b0-90bf-d38b22c4443a","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-6"},{"bbox":[88,745,113,757],"type":"footer","angle":0,"index":1000006,"text":"演示","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"is_discarded":true,"id":"04aea9bb-8ece-439d-a989-30e205458d12","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-7"}],[{"bbox":[86,74,207,87],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":0,"text":"# Slide1：什么是病毒重组","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":2,"id":"e3d98519-0fd3-4556-8bcd-d8bae4a0fe3b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-0"},{"bbox":[86,99,509,132],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"SARS-CoV-2 是一种 RNA 病毒，它的重组并不是我们在真核生物中熟悉的染色体重组，而是一种发生在复制过程中的模板切换。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"14d74f2b-47e0-48a0-8169-47bff57bf209","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-1"},{"bbox":[94,142,149,157],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（机制演示）","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"48b33fca-e79e-4b87-b018-ca13a7cb4fe3","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-2"},{"bbox":[86,169,207,183],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":3,"text":"# Slide2：与真核生物不同","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":2,"id":"23ff2df1-7942-4715-b764-db772d68233d","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-3"},{"bbox":[86,195,500,228],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"在真核生物中，重组通常发生在减数分裂过程中，涉及同源染色体的配对和片段交换，是一种结构化、受控的遗传过程。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"96ba33c7-f3ef-42d5-8b98-aedf102dcdfa","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-4"},{"bbox":[86,240,207,253],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":5,"text":"# Slide3：与原核生物不同","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":2,"id":"46c056f1-1dfc-48ca-9f12-fdf4e80ebd07","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-5"},{"bbox":[86,265,504,298],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"而在原核生物中，比如细菌，重组通常通过转化、接合或转导实现，本质上是细胞之间的基因流动，依赖外源 DNA 或质粒。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"05560be2-5d65-4bee-9ea9-3b45e24625b1","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-6"},{"bbox":[86,310,173,323],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":7,"text":"# Slide4：对比总结","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":2,"id":"6de574bd-dceb-43e3-bde8-3d818ad3520b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-7"},{"bbox":[86,335,504,386],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"相比之下，SARS-CoV-2 的重组既不依赖染色体配对，也不依赖外源 DNA 的摄取，而是发生在病毒 RNA 复制瞬间的一次“模板跳跃”。这体现了病毒进化机制的高度简化和高效。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"2efd441f-f929-4782-a63d-b7f7ea899c45","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-8"},{"bbox":[93,397,436,412],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（来3个动画，分别演示三种生物的遗传物质重组事件，进行直观对比）","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"2fa3da2f-061b-4c27-9877-8fae0c2be454","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-9"},{"bbox":[86,423,152,437],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":10,"text":"# Slide5：机制","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":2,"id":"5c55f829-d710-4fa9-8664-8b0c3e4204be","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-10"},{"bbox":[86,449,504,518],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"merge_prev":false,"text":"而 SARS-CoV-2 的模板切换之所以能够高效发生，是因为 RdRp 与 RNA 结合相对不稳定，在共感染条件下周围存在大量相似模板，同时 RNA 的序列同源性和二级结构为重新配对提供了条件。再加上冠状病毒本身具有跳跃式转录机制，使得这种‘换轨复制’不仅可能，而且高效，具有选择性。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"106f151e-ff64-4509-8025-33e2229bf602","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-11"},{"bbox":[94,530,171,544],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（动画展现机理）","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"8417ae31-d51e-4931-997b-4be42183df93","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-12"},{"bbox":[86,556,227,569],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":13,"text":"# Slide6：Omicron 例子：XBB","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":2,"id":"c1a5753d-b21b-4110-8874-09e9b72d324a","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-13"},{"bbox":[86,581,500,615],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":14,"merge_prev":false,"text":"XBB 是很好的案例：研究显示它由两个共流行的 BA.2 系谱 BJ.1 和 BM.1.1.1 重组产生，断点位于 Spike RBD 区域；其不同片段共同增强免疫逃逸和细胞融合能力。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"21f3e30a-4a89-4780-9975-8617805e578d","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-14"}],[{"bbox":[88,73,270,143],"type":"image","angle":0,"index":0,"img_path":"/f86b17a968c6f390d6ca67483a4371366fe1aa197419498c19bd88982641c95f.jpg","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"img_ratio":0.3058823529411765,"page_idx":3,"id":"13aea43a-f72a-47a3-b655-0891738663e6","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-0"},{"bbox":[129,149,231,253],"type":"image","angle":0,"index":1,"img_path":"/258d42202236c5c9c2c0c914590bc8f19f5c7a5fa25a459f8573dae2196e478b.jpg","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"img_ratio":0.2,"page_idx":3,"id":"b0b7cef6-5e54-4cdb-a903-d5ec627200b2","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-1"},{"bbox":[268,240,424,254],"type":"image_caption","angle":0,"index":2,"text":"上方展示基因组，下方展示重组","id":"0eeacdb9-7648-42f9-8186-e6291e7a32a2","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-2"},{"bbox":[86,268,218,281],"type":"image_caption","angle":0,"index":3,"text":"Slide7：为什么重组的频率","id":"ee61ec41-0d76-4d79-bb33-6adac1bb2cd0","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-3"},{"bbox":[86,294,506,344],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"Omicron 时代，重组、抗原漂移、趋同进化共同推动 SARS-CoV-2 改变抗原性。大规模系统发育研究还在 160 万条序列中识别出 589 个重组事件，约 2.7% 测序基因组有可检测重组祖先，且刺突基因区域存在重组频率峰值。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"be4d9aa7-1c95-46e9-8bc2-f2cc81091c30","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-4"},{"bbox":[86,733,506,766],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"merge_prev":false,"text":"真核重组是染色体层面的遗传重排，原核重组是细胞间基因流动，而 SARS-CoV-2 重组是病毒复制中的模板切换；它能在一次事件中整合多个有利突变，因此可使 Omicron","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"4e4f99af-5d36-4355-b9ae-0c65c3f24249","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-5"}],[{"bbox":[88,73,260,86],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"亚型快速获得免疫逃逸和传播优势。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":4,"id":"4030d3e9-1548-4a7e-8e5e-cb49c91be5a4","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"4-0"}]],"mergeConnections":[]}